  "content": "<p>此模組為 Minecraft 添加了各種面具或帽子，適合電影製作、角色扮演遊戲、大型多人線上角色扮演遊戲、多人遊戲，或與朋友一起遊玩。<span><span>關於製作面具或帽子，我建議你下載顯示配方的 JEI 模組，除非你想自己探索配方，或是在創造模式中遊玩。在一般世界的生存模式中，要製作面具或帽子，你首先需要挖掘萊納賓石，然後</span> <span>將其燒製成萊納賓，所有製作都從萊納賓開始。此模組主要專注於面具。</span></span></p><p><span><span>範例合成：</span></span></p><p><span><span><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873486154358456340/crafting9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></span></span></p><p><span><span><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873486176558936074/crafting10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873480201458303006/crafting1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873480200044838952/crafting4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873480202397839360/crafting2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873480203966500864/crafting3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873484140945739776/crafting5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873484141688127540/crafting6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873484143651069962/crafting7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/826698060892471296/873484149497921566/crafting8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"216\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
